ll key off WO_SOURCE_REPO. So a branch confirmed via\nDF_CANARY_PUSH_REPO / DARK_FACTORY_TARGET_REPO (while WO_SOURCE_REPO named a\ndifferent repo, e.g. a misconfigured host env) would be PR-opened against the\nWRONG repo — a 404 compare + a failed PR-create on a repo the branch isn't in.\n\nFix: when REMOTE-TRUTH confirms the branch, re-point WO_SOURCE_REPO to the\nrepo that actually has it, via a new sibling resolver `_df_which_repo_has_branch`\nthat echoes the confirming repo. Called via $() (subshell-safe: the answer is\nstdout, not a caller-scope out-var — a $()-set var is lost to the subshell\nfork, the bug the first out-var attempt hit). Fail-closed preserved: no\nconfirmation → no re-point (empty), the existing honest-refusal fires.\n\nRegression tests C5e (branch-in-target confirmed → re-point target =\ndark-factory-target) + C5f (404 in all repos → empty, no false re-point).\nSuite 13/13.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RKKetzSMEreU8bCpnW7agr\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-08-01T02:43:06Z","author":{"name":"odinlabs-ai","email":"mitchell@odin-labs.ai"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1214420399,"node_id":"R_kgDOSGKVrw","name":"odin-labs","full_name":"odin-labs-ai/odin-labs","private":true,"owner":{"login":"odin-labs-ai","id":256870016,"node_id":"O_kgDOD0-GgA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256870016?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/odin-labs-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/odin-labs-ai/subscriptions","organizations_u